__row\"><b>Tắm</b><span class=\"bk-svc__price\">88.000₫ – 660.000₫</span></div><div class=\"bk-svc__meta\"><span><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined \" style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1;\">schedule</span>45'</span><span class=\"is-on\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined \" style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1;\">home_work</span>Có tận nhà</span></div></div><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined bk-svc__check\" style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1; font-variation-settings: &quot;FILL&quot; 1;\">check_circle</span></button><button class=\"bk-svc \" type=\"button\"><div class=\"bk-svc__ic\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgb(219, 234, 254), rgb(99, 102, 241));\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined \" style=\"font-size: 28px; line-height: 1;\">content_cut</span></div><div class=\"bk-svc__body\"><div class=\"bk-svc__row\"><b>Cắt tỉa lông</b><span class=\"bk-svc__price\">145.000₫ – 440.000₫</span></div><div class=\"bk-svc__meta\"><span><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined \" style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1;\">schedule</span>90'</span><span class=\"is-off\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined \" style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1;\">store</span>Chỉ tại spa</span></div></div></button><button class=\"bk-svc \" type=\"button\"><div class=\"bk-svc__ic\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgb(254, 243, 199), rgb(245, 158, 11));\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined \" style=\"font-size: 28px; line-height: 1;\">cut</span></div><div class=\"bk-svc__body\"><div class=\"bk-svc__row\"><b>Cạo lông</b><span class=\"bk-svc__price\">88.000₫ – 385.000₫</span></div><div class=\"bk-svc__meta\"><span><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined \" style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1;\">schedule</span>60'</span><span class=\"is-on\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined \" style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1;\">home_work</span>Có tận nhà</span></div></div></button><button class=\"bk-svc \" type=\"button\"><div class